  "question": {
    "text": "A block starts moving up a fixed inclined plane of inclination <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mtext>60</mtext></mrow> <mo>&#8728;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;with a velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and stops after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>2&#160;s</mtext></math>. The approximate value of the coefficient of friction is [<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>]",
